  "details": "Ruby is an extensible, interpreted, object-oriented, scripting language. It has features to process text files and to perform system management tasks.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * resolv: resolv gem: Denial of Service via uncontrolled memory growth from crafted DNS responses (CVE-2026-80212)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * ruby %check fails in Konflux: Rinda multicast tests need network device [almalinux-9.8.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-255606)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
